SUMMARY:Strength for Climbers (Sunnyvale)
LOCATION:Movement Sunnyvale
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Oscar (Tsz) N.\nAvailability at sync time: 18 spaces\nFunctional Strength Training for Climbers (FSTC) combines body weight training\, climbing specific movements and functional core work to improve strength\, balance\, and stability through the entire body\; including the legs\, back\, core and shoulders. This class also provides intentional mobility work to increase range of motion\, help you become a more agile\, and lessen the chance of injury in common areas where climbers tend to develop instability.\nBook: https://portal.movementgyms.com/sunnyvale/n/climbing-yoga-fitness-calendar
